# Saved builds cannot remain in memory

Current:

```python
self.builds = {}
```

Every restart destroys everything.

`pow_save_build()` must persist to SQLite.

Also this:

```python
build_id = sha256(name)
```

means saving `"Desk Agent"` twice overwrites the same conceptual ID.

Use UUID/ULID and explicit versioning:

```text
build_id
build_version
created_at
request_json
route_json
```

Eventually:

```text
build:abc
v1
v2
v3
```

is much more useful.

